# Third-party notices — Hub channel verticals

Bundled third-party dependencies shipped inside the pinned OpenClaw channel supply, per channel
(implementation doc §4.6 notice 9 / plan §9 step 7). The install step refuses to install a channel
whose section is missing here. Integrity pinning (channel-pins.json) is the tamper boundary; this file
records the license provenance of the bytes that pin ships. Licenses are grouped; each line is a package@version.

